        "The children are boring.",
        "The children are bored.",
        "The children are tired.",
        "The children are rich."
      ],
      "correct": 1,
      "explanation": "Aburrido with estar means bored; with ser it means boring.",
      "optionNotes": [
        "Boring would be son aburridos.",
        null,
        "Tired is cansados.",
        "Rich is ricos."
